---
layout: default
---
<div class="research-home">
  <section class="research-hero">
    <div class="row align-items-center">
      <div class="col-lg-8 order-2 order-lg-1">
        <div class="eyebrow">Artificial intelligence research portfolio</div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Sakib Hossain</h1>
        <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Professional links">
          <a class="hero-button primary" href="mailto:sakib@kaist.ac.kr"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i>Email</a>
          <a class="hero-button" href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9VM2SHYAAAAJ"><i class="ai ai-google-scholar"></i>Google Scholar</a>
          <a class="hero-button" href="https://github.com/Sakib-Hossain-Shovon"><i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i>GitHub</a>
          <a class="hero-button" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/md-sakib-hossain-shovon-601738178/"
            ><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin"></i>LinkedIn</a
          >
          <a class="hero-button" href="{{ '/cv/' | relative_url }}"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-arrow-down"></i>CV</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-4 order-1 order-lg-2 text-center">
        <div id="intro-media" class="carousel slide intro-media" data-ride="carousel" data-interval="5000" aria-label="Research introduction gallery">
          <div class="carousel-inner">
            <div class="carousel-item active">
              <div class="intro-media-frame">
                {% include figure.liquid loading="eager" path="assets/img/sakib_githubio.jpg" class="hero-photo" sizes="300px" alt="Portrait of Sakib Hossain" cache_bust=true %}
              </div>
              <div class="intro-media-caption">Researcher · builder · mentor</div>
            </div>
            <div class="carousel-item">
              <div class="intro-media-frame">
                {% include figure.liquid loading="lazy" path="assets/img/research-generative.svg" class="hero-photo intro-illustration" sizes="300px" alt="Generative AI research illustration" %}
              </div>
              <div class="intro-media-caption">Generative and visual AI</div>
            </div>
            <div class="carousel-item">
              <div class="intro-media-frame">
                {% include figure.liquid loading="lazy" path="assets/img/research-3d.svg" class="hero-photo intro-illustration" sizes="300px" alt="3D vision research illustration" %}
              </div>
              <div class="intro-media-caption">3D vision and world models</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ol class="carousel-indicators intro-indicators">
            <li data-target="#intro-media" data-slide-to="0" class="active"></li>
            <li data-target="#intro-media" data-slide-to="1"></li>
            <li data-target="#intro-media" data-slide-to="2"></li>
          </ol>
          <a class="carousel-control-prev intro-control" href="#intro-media" role="button" data-slide="prev" aria-label="Previous introduction slide">
            <span class="fa-solid fa-chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </a>
          <a class="carousel-control-next intro-control" href="#intro-media" role="button" data-slide="next" aria-label="Next introduction slide">
            <span class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-9">
        <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
        <div class="about-copy">
          <p>
            I am an <strong>M.S. student in Artificial Intelligence at KAIST</strong> and a researcher at the
            <strong>Statistical Artificial Intelligence Lab (SAIL)</strong>, Kim Jaechul Graduate School of AI, South Korea, advised by
            <a href="https://sail.kaist.ac.kr/en/members/jaesik">Professor Jaesik Choi</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            Before joining KAIST, I received my B.Sc. in Computer Science and Engineering from
            <strong>American International University-Bangladesh (AIUB)</strong>. My research experience has also included work with
            <strong>The University of Queensland, Australia</strong> and <strong>Qatar University, Qatar</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>
            I am also the <strong>Co-Founder &amp; CEO of <a href="https://neurontree.ai/founders-sakib/">NeuronTreeAI</a></strong
            >, a nonprofit initiative co-founded with <a href="https://neurontree.ai/founders-moni/">Prof. Mohammad Ali Moni</a> focused on AI
            education, research mentorship, and making advanced research knowledge more accessible.
          </p>
          <p>
            My long-term research goal is to become a <strong>professor at a top university</strong> and
            <strong>launch an AI startup that empowers society for a better future</strong>.
            <strong
              >My primary immediate goal is to secure a PhD position for the Fall 2027 intake at a top-10 university in the United States.</strong
            >
          </p>
          <p class="contact-callout">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> For research discussions and collaborations, contact
            <a href="mailto:sakib@kaist.ac.kr">sakib@kaist.ac.kr</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-publications">
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-end">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Research works</div>
        <h2 class="section-heading">Selected publications</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="{{ '/publications/' | relative_url }}">All publications <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
    </div>
    {% include selected_papers.liquid %}
  </section>

  <section class="home-section conducted-projects">
    <div class="eyebrow">Conducted projects</div>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Research projects</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Current and prior applied research initiatives.</p>
    <div class="row">
      {% assign featured_projects = site.projects | where: 'featured', true | sort: 'importance' %}
      {% for project in featured_projects %}
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
          <article class="research-card compact-project-card">
            <a class="project-thumb" href="{{ project.url | relative_url }}">
              {%- include figure.liquid path=project.img class="mb-0" sizes="180px" alt=project.title -%}
            </a>
            <div class="research-card-body">
              <h3>{{ project.title }}</h3>
              <p>{{ project.description }}</p>
              <div class="project-links">
                <a href="{{ project.url | relative_url }}">Project <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <a class="hero-button" href="{{ '/projects/' | relative_url }}">View all projects <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section research-interests">
    <div class="eyebrow">Research at a glance</div>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Core interests</h2>
    <div class="interest-grid">
      <div class="interest-card">
        <h3>Diffusion &amp; Flow Matching</h3>
        <p>Generative modeling, stochastic interpolants, sampling, scheduler optimization, and efficient generation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="interest-card">
        <h3>Physical AI &amp; World Models</h3>
        <p>Visual world modeling, physical reasoning, embodied and interactive AI, and scene dynamics.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="interest-card">
        <h3>3D Vision</h3>
        <p>3D representation learning, geometry-aware learning, scene understanding, reconstruction, and rendering.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="interest-card">
        <h3>Explainable AI</h3>
        <p>Mechanistic interpretability, neuron polysemanticity, representation analysis, and concept disentanglement.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="interest-card">
        <h3>Inference Optimization</h3>
        <p>Efficient inference, few-step generation, model acceleration, and test-time optimization.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="interest-card">
        <h3>Multimodal Foundation Models</h3>
        <p>Vision-language models, multimodal reasoning, cross-modal representations, and foundation model adaptation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-news">
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-end">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Recent news</div>
        <h2 class="section-heading">Updates</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="{{ '/news/' | relative_url }}">All news <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
    </div>
    <div class="news">
      <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="table table-sm table-borderless">
          {% assign latest_news = site.news | reverse %}
          {% for item in latest_news limit: 3 %}
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">
                {% if item.date_display %}{{ item.date_display }}{% else %}{{ item.date | date: '%b %Y' }}{% endif %}
              </th>
              <td>{{ item.content | remove: '<p>' | remove: '</p>' | emojify }}</td>
            </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
